SUMMARY:VRChat International Science Community
DESCRIPTION:集会: VRChat International Science Community 開催日時: 20
 26年11月7日 23:30 開催時間: 30分 Let's talk about science! We hold 
 LTs (Lightning Talks) hosted by group members about once every two weeks. F
 eel free to join usǃ There's absolutely no need to worry about not knowing
  anyone of the existing members․ We wish you a fruitful exchange․ Expec
 ted Level: University student (Year 1-2 undergraduate) level Field: Natural
  science (Physics\, Chemistry\, etc.) Time: Sat 14:30 - 15:00 UTC Language:
  English 【Short description in Japanese】 さめさん主催のVRChat物
 理学集会の国際版集会です．使用言語は英語のみです．
